The following LASzip files were modified to add laszip_get_chunk_starts():
libs/laszip/src/lasreadpoint.hpp, libs/laszip/src/laszip_dll.cpp and
libs/laszip/dll/laszip_api.h.

src/culaz.cu contains a CUDA port of the LASzip decoder (arithmetic decoder,
symbol and bit models, integer compressor and point format 2 decompression).

